  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Verbs with «at»",
   "texto": [
    "Many verbs are followed by **at** + infinitive: **lover at** (promise), **begynder at** (start), **prøver at** (try): **Jeg lovede at komme tidligt.** = I promised to come early.",
    "**Jeg begynder at blive sulten.** = I'm starting to be hungry."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Expressions with «at»",
   "texto": [
    "**Det er svært at** = is difficult: **Det er svært at vente så længe.** = It is difficult to wait so long.",
    "**Uden at** = without: **Spis uden at vente.** = Eat without waiting.",
    "**I stedet for at** = instead of: **I stedet for at vente, gik jeg.** = Instead of waiting, I left."
   ]
